      "color": "6",
      "text": "# Experiment Matrix — Paper Architecture\n*Cascade DOM→P-text→P-SoM→SoM · Phantom space 3 arms · Section mapping · ~108 cells (~135K ep)*\n**Final scope**: 6 sites × 3 models × 6 modes (5 base + 1 diamond control)"
    },

    {
      "id": "scopeglobalaaaaa1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 200,
      "y": -90,
      "width": 3000,
      "height": 90,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "**Sites (6)**: VWA cls 234 / red 210 / shop 466 + WA red 106 / shop 192 / sa 182 = ~1390 task/condition  |  **Models (3)**: B0 Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B (proxy) + B1 Qwen3-VL-4B (local) + Claude Opus 4.7  |  **Modes (6)**: DOM / SoM / Vision / **P-text** / **P-SoM** / **P-prompt** (3 phantom arms 共享 4-fold drop-in)"
    },

    {
      "id": "cascade_groupaaa1",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -100,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 3300,
      "height": 540,
