      "label": "CASCADE — Token-monotonic representation upgrade path (paper §1 hook)"
    },

    {
      "id": "mode_dom00aaaaaa1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -40,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 380,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## DOM\n*origin baseline*\n\n• text: AXTree (hierarchical)\n• prompt: DOM\n• image: ✗\n• cost: ~3K text\n\n**测什么**: text-only baseline, hierarchical tree-traversal trajectory\n\n**Section 4** baseline\n**Section 5** axis 1 control (DOM-prompt 锚)\n**Phantom**: ✅ corner #1 (origin)"
    },

    {
      "id": "mode_ptext0aaaaa1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 460,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 380,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "## P-text\n*axis 1 alone (DOM-prompt 锚)*\n\n• text: **`[SOM_MARKS]`** flat list\n• prompt: DOM (unchanged)\n• image: ✗\n• cost: ~3K text (regex filter from AXTree)\n\n**测什么**: 文本 ontology shift — hierarchical → flat indexed (browse → select)\n\n**Section 5** M2 axis isolation (Format-swap subspace)\n**Phantom**: ✅ corner #5"
    },

    {
      "id": "mode_psom00aaaaa1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 960,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 380,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## P-SoM ⭐\n*axis 1+2 compound (cube center, paper hero)*\n\n• text: `[SOM_MARKS]`\n• prompt: SoM-style\n• image: ✗\n• cost: ~3K text\n\n**测什么**: M1 ⊕ M2 compound activation — visual prompting w/o image + flat-list scanning. Emergent 3 unique tasks B0 red\n\n**Section 5** paper hero\n**Phantom**: ✅ corner #7"
    },

    {
      "id": "mode_som000aaaaa1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1460,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 380,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## SoM\n*image-on cube endpoint (NOT phantom)*\n\n• text: `[SOM_MARKS]`\n• prompt: SoM\n• image: ✓ (annotated screenshot)\n• cost: ~3K text + ~1.5K image\n\n**测什么**: full multimodal baseline — paper baseline 比较锚\n\n**Section 4** baseline\n**Section 5** axis 3 endpoint (vs P-SoM isolate image effect)\n**Phantom**: ❌ image-on out-of-space"
    },

    {
      "id": "mode_vision0aaaa1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1960,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 380,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## Vision\n*image-only (cube 之外, axis 1 = no text)*\n\n• text: ∅\n• prompt: SoM-like\n• image: ✓ (raw screenshot)\n• cost: ~1.5K image\n\n**测什么**: pure visual baseline — counter-evidence (Phantom 不是 mode-specific artifact, Vision 也 affected)\n\n**Section 4** baseline (3rd axis)\n**Phantom**: ❌ cube 之外"
    },

