      "id": "mode_pprompt0aaa1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2460,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 380,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "## P-prompt\n*axis 2 alone (AXTree 锚)* — DIAMOND control\n\n• text: AXTree (unchanged from DOM)\n• prompt: SoM-style\n• image: ✗\n• cost: ~3K text\n\n**测什么**: visual prompting w/o image — Mirage subspace, falsifies \"mismatched parsing necessarily fails\"\n\n**Section 5** axis 2 isolation\n**Phantom**: ✅ corner #3 (only B0+B1 cls/red, NOT shopping)"
    },

