    {
      "id": "diamond_4foldddd1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 320,
      "y": 760,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 580,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## 4-fold drop-in property\n*4 phantom corners 共享 by construction*\n\n**(a) cost ≈ DOM** (no image embedding tax)\n**(b) latency ~50% lower** (no image inference, cls 4×)\n**(c) signal AUROC ≥ baseline** ✅\n  — 5/5 phantom `overall_usable=True`\n  — red P-text 0.793 = 5-mode max\n**(d) drop-one oracle 1.7-3.8pp ✅**\n  — B0 red CI 全 exclude 0\n\n*(a)(b) definitional / (c)(d) emergent*\n\n---\n\n**2×2 ablation diamond edges**:\n• DOM ↔ P-text: axis 1 @ DOM-prompt\n• P-prompt ↔ P-SoM: axis 1 @ SoM-prompt → invariance\n• DOM ↔ P-prompt: axis 2 @ AXTree\n• P-text ↔ P-SoM: axis 2 @ [SOM_MARKS] → invariance\n• DOM ↔ P-SoM: cube diagonal compound"
    },

    {
      "id": "section_groupaaa1",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 1450,
