    },

    {
      "id": "section4_baseline",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1500,
      "y": 720,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## §4 Empirical Findings (baseline)\n*needs*: DOM / SoM / Vision × 6 sites × 3 models = 54 cells\n\n**Done**: B0 cls/red 5-mode FRESH ✅\n**Active**: B0 dom shopping (~9/466)\n**Pending**: B0 shop SoM/Vision / B1 全 / Claude 全 / WA 全\n\n**Codex #11** ready (~30K tok)"
    },

    {
      "id": "section5_mechaani",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1500,
      "y": 940,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## §5 Mechanism (phantom + diamond) ⭐\n*needs*: P-text / P-SoM × cls/red × B0+B1 + diamond P-prompt × cls/red × B0+B1\n\n**Done**: B0 cls/red 4 phantom ✅\n**Active**: B0 P-prompt red ~16/210\n**Pending**: B0 P-prompt cls / B1 4 phantom / B1 P-prompt 2-cell\n\n**Codex #13** queued (~50K tok, 待 #11 + P-prompt red done)"
    },

    {
      "id": "section6_routinggg",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1500,
      "y": 1160,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## §6 Routing (Tier 1+2) — paper真正最值钱工作量\n*needs*: routing infra + Tier 1 oracle (TF-IDF+LR) + Tier 2 first-step trigger\n\n**Done**: signal AUROC ≥ baseline `9d7e99f` ✅, infra scaffold ready\n**Pending**: Tier 1 prototype (~3 d) + Tier 2 trigger (~7-10 d) — Week 4-5\n\n**Codex #16** blocked on prototype done"
    },

    {
      "id": "section7_general11",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2320,
      "y": 720,
      "width": 820,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## §7 Generalization\n*cross-site + cross-model*\n\n**Cross-site (within VWA)**: shopping 5-mode 全 pending; WA × 3 sites × B0+B1 × 5 modes = 30 cells 全 pending\n\n**Cross-model**: Claude Opus 4.7 cls+red 5-mode = 10 cells 全 pending\n\n**Cross-capability** (B1 vs B0): B1 capability profile done ✅; B1 cls phantom_som active 184+/234 (~10-15 d)\n\n**Codex #14/15/17** blocked on data"
    },

    {
      "id": "section8_susstain",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2320,
      "y": 1060,
      "width": 820,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## §8 Discussion (sustainability + Green AI)\n*multi-metric Pareto: cost / latency / carbon*\n\n**Done**: fig9 regional carbon (B1, 45 region, India 632 / Norway 29 g/kWh) ✅\n**Done**: B1 measured energy (cls/red × DOM/SoM/Vision) ✅\n**Pending**: B0 token-based carbon estimator (Tier 3 future)\n\n**Codex #18** blocked on 全部 data done (paper end-stage)"
    },

