    {
      "id": "tier1_critical000",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -40,
      "y": 1560,
      "width": 1600,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## Tier 1 — Paper-critical\n*5 base modes everywhere — without these, paper 写不出*\n\n**Section 4 baseline**: DOM / SoM / Vision × 6 sites × 3 models\n**Section 5 mechanism**: P-text + P-SoM × cls+red × B0+B1\n**Section 6 routing**: Tier 1 oracle + Tier 2 first-step trigger\n**Section 7 generalization**: cross-site shopping + WA + Claude\n\n**Critical path bottleneck**: 14-cell rerun (B0 cls/red phantom + B1 phantom 4-cell) blocked on RunPod $200 approval"
    },

    {
      "id": "tier2_diamond000",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1620,
      "y": 1560,
      "width": 1580,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## Tier 2 — Diamond completeness / nice-to-have\n*P-prompt diamond + B1 P-prompt cross-cap + Claude all-modes*\n\n**P-prompt** (axis 2 alone): only cls + red, NOT shopping. mechanism Section 5 用. B0 red 跑中 (~16/210), B0 cls blocked, B1 cls+red 2-cell queued (~14-20 d)\n\n**B1 P-prompt cross-cap**: Section 7 cross-capability bonus, paper 不依赖\n\n**Claude P-prompt 6th mode**: nice-to-have if budget allow\n\n**总策略**: Tier 1 全 done 后再考虑 Tier 2 budget"
    },

