      "id": "status_currrent01",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -100,
      "y": 1900,
      "width": 3300,
      "height": 350,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "## CURRENT STATUS (live, snapshot 2026-05-02)\n\n### Active 跑中\n• 🔄 B0 P-prompt reddit (PID 2075552, ~16/210, ~6h ETA)\n• 🔄 B1 phantom_som cls (PID 1821957, task 184+/234, ~10-15d, GPU contention seonglae 95%)\n• 🔄 B0 dom shopping clean re-run (PID 1106560, ~9/466, ~9h)\n\n### Done paper-grade FRESH (Phase A pre-fix, 14-cell rerun 后会废)\n• ✅ B0 cls 5-mode (DOM/SoM/Vision/P-text/P-SoM, 04-27/28)\n• ✅ B0 red 5-mode (DOM/SoM/Vision/P-text/P-SoM, 04-27/28) — drop-one CI 全 sig\n\n### Blocked\n• 🚫 14-cell paper-grade rerun (B0 + B1 phantom cells with Phase A patches) — RunPod $200 approval pending\n• 🚫 Myriad — UCL CGNAT 物理级 blocked (`MYRIAD_SMOKE_REPORT.md`)\n• 🚫 学长 sync 时间 pending\n\n### Pending chains (queue_chain.sh)\n• ⏳ B0 P-prompt cls — wait B1 phantom_som cls done (~10d)\n• ⏳ B1 phantom 4-cell (cls/red × P-text/P-SoM) — launched 04-29 PID 1145483, ~30-40 d GPU contention\n• ⏳ B0 phantom shopping pair — wait B0 dom shopping done\n• ⏳ B1 P-prompt 2-cell (Tier 2) — wait B1 4-cell done, ~14-20 d"
    },

